  "description": "\u201cEqual triangles which are on the same base and on the same side are also in the same parallels.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 39 (G.68)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 D B C \u27e9 on / B C /\n00:20 2 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: segment(A, D) \u2192 / A D /\n00:28 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: ? \u00ac(/ A D / \u2225 / B C /) \u2192 parallel_line(A, / B C /) \u2192 / A E / \u2225 / B C /, segment(E, C) \u2192 / E C /\n00:36 4 \u00b7 ASSERT: / A E / \u2225 / B C / \u2192 \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 E B C \u27e9\n00:48 5 \u00b7 ASSERT: \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 D B C \u27e9, \u27e8 A B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 E B C \u27e9 \u2192 \u27e8 D B C \u27e9 = \u27e8 E B C \u27e9 \u21d2\u21d0\n01:01 6 \u00b7 \u2234: / A D / \u2225 / B C /\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.68 \u2022 v2",
